## Verify

Run the checks with Testee. Testee 0.6.1 checks a commit in its own worktree.

```bash
testee verify                   # every required check
testee verify --profile quick   # quick profile (partial gate)
testee verify pytest            # one named check
testee status                   # GREEN, RED, or NO VERDICT for the commit
testee show                     # latest summary
```

Commit your work before you verify. Testee keeps run state outside the project.
Commit `devenv.lock` and `uv.lock`. Testee refuses a stale lock.
